        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli yaamaá kay ka'amiís baraá Kana'aniro an kuká': Múk gaa ka'amiis a kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari nee Yoshua garmoó Nuni, baraá ka'amisuuwo tina alee/imisiyé' nee bariisér uren ar tlahh'aá xoorór Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamu kina ka'amiís ar loohír tsawdo, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira hara'ayín dír Mose, as kiwa ka'amiisi dír tlahh'aá gwaleél nee tlaqi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma tlahh'aá tsár nee tlaqi kaa yaamuuíní ka'aás gayuú yaaér Yordaniro da/aáwá ale, ala tlahhoó Laáwi kwaa aalírí haniisiiká baraá tla/angw'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xwaylár Yosefu tlahhi'iiwós a tsár, tlahhoó Manase nee oo Efraimu, ala tlahhoó Laáwi aalír yaamu gaa slayká, ala aqo gixsadaá maray'ín ngi tleehhiya', nee wa/ángw hikwaaín ngiwa de'ena', nee dír muruú /aymar'ín nguwa amohhe'eesiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli yaamuudá' giri qasmís ar loohír tsawdo ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira hara'ayín dír Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looár wake tlahhoó Yuda ina amór Yoshua káy baraá Gilgali. Kalebu garmoó Yefune, oo guruú doó Kenisi Yoshua guri báy, «Yoshúa, án ngi slaá' kuúng axweesantadár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa oó' dír Mose, heé Mungú, a insleér. Axweesantadá' a daanduú aníng nee kuúng baldá' baraá yaamaá Kadesh-barnearo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae kureerieé' a mibeeri tsiyáhh Mose sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng iwa ya/aáw Kadesh-barneár wa ale as yaamu ngiwa tsawtsawuusár aw. Aníng niwa amoodá' wa wayaá', looeemaadá' naa ár ina ooár áw dír Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukdá' nee aníng taa alkoomaan muu sleémeero kuna dae tsaát iri naá/, ala aníng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúeé' una ilaiwaá/ ar inkihhimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae Mose yaamuuká' ngaa dir'eénií alqadín, iwa kaahi, ‹Yaamuusingá' taa adarát ya'aawoge kuúng nee na/iiwoge in alá' ay kureeraá kureér, asma kuúng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúeé' una ilaiwá/ ar inkihhimu.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ay hamí ga/aaweek, adoorí ni diriia AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iga deaaén a slaáf ar adoodá' ngira oó'. Kureeraá mibeeraá tsiyáhh nee kooán iga /aáy iimír baalaadá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ /aymuudá' nguwa oó' dír Mose, qoomár xoorór Israeli iwa hi'iimaamít baraá xaanxáy wa ale. Laarí aníng kureerieé' a mibeeri dakaát nee kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ti gawít tam hamí, aqo adoodár baldá' Mose iwa ya/abiít an i kaáhh, slaqwara a aleesláw, tam waayaá dooeé' sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamí daxta kuúng un firiím, yaamukaá tlom'i aníng i haniisang ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó' baalaadae. Kuúng a xú' baalaadae múk Anaki baraaká' gana hoót, slám koo/ír gixsadu ka gawit. Barnaxes AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a dinkwa nee aníng, mukwí uqo tlatlahhaás ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua Kalebu garmoó Yefune guri tsuúq, guri gixsár Hebronirí haniís as ngiwa aali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe yaamaá Hebroni Kalebu, garmoó Yefune, heé guruú doó Kenisi giri óh, ay laarí a kooín, asma Kalebu AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguú múk Israeli guna ilaiwawaá/ ar inkihhimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú yaamaá gixsár Hebroni bál geeraawo a kun babay Kiriat-arba. Heewí ta bay Arba ku ló'wa iiatleér ta múk hatlá' sleémeero oo Anakiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamu sleémeero niri amohhoouyé' asma slaqwara i káhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
